    <span>Closet Systems</span><span class="marquee-dot">·</span>
    <span>Office &amp; Business</span><span class="marquee-dot">·</span>
    <span>Move-In Setups</span><span class="marquee-dot">·</span>
    <span>Decluttering</span><span class="marquee-dot">·</span>
    <span>Dallas Area</span><span class="marquee-dot">·</span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- INTRO -->
<section class="intro">
  <div class="intro-image">
    <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Polished Pear & Company logo" class="intro-logo-large">
  </div>
  <div class="intro-content">
    <p class="section-eyebrow">Elevated Spaces, Thoughtfully Done</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Calm lives here.<br><em>We'll help you find it.</em></h2>
    <p class="section-body">Life is full. Your space shouldn't add to the chaos. At Polished Pear &amp; Company, we believe an organized environment is more than aesthetics — it's peace of mind, reclaimed time, and a home that works for you.</p>
    <p class="section-body">We design personalized systems that are beautiful, functional, and built to stay that way — long after we're gone.</p>
    <div class="divider-leaf"></div>
    <p class="section-body" style="font-style: italic; font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--sage-dark);">"We don't just organize your space — we transform how you live in it."</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SERVICES -->
<section class="services" id="services">
  <div class="services-header">
    <p class="section-eyebrow">What We Do</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Every space <em>deserves</em><br>to feel this good.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="services-grid">
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-number">01</div>
      <h3 class="service-title">Home Organizing</h3>
      <p class="service-desc">From overflowing closets to cluttered living rooms, we assess, sort, and build custom systems tailored to how your family actually lives.</p>
      <span class="service-tag">Kitchens · Closets · Living Spaces</span>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-number">02</div>
      <h3 class="service-title">Pantry & Kitchen</h3>
      <p class="service-desc">Transform your kitchen into a space that inspires — with labeled containers, logical flow, and a pantry you'll actually want to show off.</p>
      <span class="service-tag">Pantry Design · Meal Prep Systems</span>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-number">03</div>
      <h3 class="service-title">Closet Systems</h3>
      <p class="service-desc">Curated wardrobe edits and smart storage solutions that make getting dressed a joy — not a scavenger hunt.</p>
      <span class="service-tag">Wardrobe Edits · Custom Storage</span>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-number">04</div>
      <h3 class="service-title">Business & Office</h3>
      <p class="service-desc">Productive environments start with organized spaces. We bring the same thoughtful approach to offices, studios, and commercial spaces.</p>
      <span class="service-tag">Office Setup · Filing Systems</span>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-number">05</div>
      <h3 class="service-title">Move-In & Unpack</h3>
      <p class="service-desc">Start your new chapter the right way. We unpack, organize, and set up every room so your new house feels like home from day one.</p>
      <span class="service-tag">Full Unpack · Room Setup</span>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-number">06</div>
      <h3 class="service-title">Maintenance Plans</h3>
      <p class="service-desc">Life happens. Our seasonal refresh visits keep your systems working beautifully, so the calm doesn't fade after we leave.</p>
      <span class="service-tag">Seasonal Refresh · Ongoing Support</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROCESS -->
<section class="process" id="process">
  <div class="process-header">
    <p class="section-eyebrow">How It Works</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Simple, personal,<br><em>stress-free.</em></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="process-steps">
    <div class="process-step">
      <div class="step-circle">I</div>
      <h3 class="step-title">Consult</h3>
      <p class="step-desc">A free conversation to understand your space, your lifestyle, and your goals.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="process-step">
      <div class="step-circle">II</div>
      <h3 class="step-title">Assess</h3>
      <p class="step-desc">We visit your space, identify what's working, and create a custom plan.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="process-step">
      <div class="step-circle">III</div>
      <h3 class="step-title">Transform</h3>
      <p class="step-desc">We get to work — sorting, curating, and installing your personalized systems.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="process-step">
      <div class="step-circle">IV</div>
